{"id":"nfejnc7hq3uvml8n86zhfrpc7","title":"博理科技获超5亿元融资，3D打印机器人零部件批量供货","originalTitle":null,"summary":"博理科技宣布完成B2轮与B+轮股权融资，合计金额超5亿元（B2轮由基石资本与金沙江联合资本领投，B+轮由经纬创投领投）。募资将用于高分子材料研发、装备扩产及具身智能应用开发。公司已向优必选、卓益得等企业交付超1000万件零部件，并获上市公司长盈精密参投。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"华尔街见闻"},"links":{"original":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3786210"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-18T13:01:41.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-18T14:29:35.962Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-18T14:29:35.962Z","category":"funding","tags":["融资","产品上线"],"score":51,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"69aa168e-d993-4064-bcc1-70f44512762b","title":"博理科技完成B2及B+轮融资，累计超5亿元用于技术研发与扩产"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"69aa168e-d993-4064-bcc1-70f44512762b","title":"博理科技完成B2及B+轮融资，累计超5亿元用于技术研发与扩产"}],"topics":[{"slug":"funding","name":"融资与并购"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fhS0G2il7BmE","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}